{
  "title": "Customers, Guests and Privacy: Merged Accounts, Retention and Checkout Fields | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "Not everyone who buys from you has an account. The CrestApps Customers feature keeps a record for every buyer, merges a guest's orders into their account when they sign up with a confirmed email, erases or anonymizes guests' personal data after the time you choose, adds your own fields to the checkout with Checkout details, and gives staff their own My Account page.\n\nIn this video:\n• Guest customers and merged accounts\n• How long guest data is kept\n• Your own fields at checkout: Checkout details\n• What the buyer sees\n• Staff and My Account\n• Use cases",
